webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3586606Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3687563Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3698499Z ^[[0m
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3699093Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3699933Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3700161Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3700579Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3701118Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3701401Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3701580Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3701938Z    if you are ready to continue.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3702122Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3702465Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3703033Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3703458Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3706639Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3707034Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3707427Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3707755Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3709507Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3710243Z    can use Nix.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3710775Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3710974Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3711384Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3711916Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3712730Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3716794Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3717127Z I will:
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3717456Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3717765Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3718320Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3718762Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3719135Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3719397Z  - install Nix in /nix
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3719670Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3720055Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3720662Z    /root
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3733682Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3734505Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3744913Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3745478Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3745976Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3747117Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3747728Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3765601Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3766381Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3776398Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T08:42:16.3777339Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
